think With BLAKE2b GREEN as the hash foundation, the crux-first next Season G primitive is SHA-512 — the hash standard Ed25519 signs with (RFC 8032 / FIPS 180-4), so it is the direct next stone toward the signing primitive that unblocks the Lotus signed carry.
think Same shape as BLAKE2b, and provable now: pure 64-bit arithmetic, a published FIPS 180-4 known-answer, and Zig's std.crypto SHA-512 as an independent oracle. The primitive calls no std.crypto; std is used only inside the selftest.
